Description: Self-service MCP server catalog and client config generator
 mcprack lets an admin register MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers once;
 users log in (local account or Active Directory), pick which servers they
 need and which client they use (Claude or GitHub Copilot), and download a
 ready-to-use client configuration file. Credentials are never stored by
 mcprack itself — they live in Vaultwarden, fetched at download time.
